<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Hugo Theme on your site title</title><link>https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/tags/hugo-theme/</link><description>Recent content in Hugo Theme on your site title</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ja</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 11:03:05 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/tags/hugo-theme/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>月白のインストール方法</title><link>https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/post/2016/05/how-to-install-geppaku-theme/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 11:03:05 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://koooge.github.io/hugo-theme-geppaku/ja/post/2016/05/how-to-install-geppaku-theme/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Geppaku is bluish white theme for &lt;a href="http://gohugo.io/"&gt;Hugo&lt;/a&gt;.
It is color name in Japan. Chinese character is &amp;ldquo;月白&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;月白（げっぱく）とは、月の光を思わせる薄い青みを含んだ白色のことです。
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;via &lt;a href="http://irocore.com/geppaku/"&gt;http://irocore.com/geppaku/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Geppaku is the white color including a thin blue that reminiscent of the light of the moon.
(If that translate is wrong, please inform me using PullRequest.)&lt;/p&gt;
